# Shape geometry, ellipse (engine backlog 14/16; DISCREPANCIES `SHAPE-AWARE-GEOMETRY`).
# An ellipse's inscribed rectangle is about 1/sqrt(2) of its axes, so a
# multi-line label sized as if the node were rectangular crosses the curve;
# an incident edge must land on the curve, not on the bounding box. Parse
# model unaffected; tools/shape-check.js asserts the geometry.
figdown 0.1 block
node agg "Aggregation and\nreplication service" shape=ellipse
node src "Source"
node snk "Sink"
edge src -> agg
edge agg -> snk
pin src at=(20,20)
pin agg at=(200,120)
pin snk at=(380,20)
